<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 383 0 R
/T (When reimbursements are delayed by weeks or months, organizations must continue paying staff, contractors, and vendors while waiting for funds to arrive. Prior research by the Urban Institute \(2013\) highlights the prevalence of this challenge for nonprofit organizations in the United States:)
/E (When reimbursements are delayed by weeks or months, organizations must continue paying staff, contractors, and vendors while waiting for funds to arrive. Prior research by the Urban Institute \(2013\) highlights the prevalence of this challenge for nonprofit organizations in the United States:)
/Pg 14 0 R
