/E (Respondents reported receiving funding from multiple levels of government, including federal, state, and local agencies. While 74 percent reported federal grants, many also receive state grants \(67 percent\) and county or local grants \(45 percent\). Among organizations receiving contracts, the distribution is even more concentrated at the state and local level, with county or local contracts \(29 percent\) and state contracts \(19 percent\) reported more frequently than federal contracts \(17 percent\).)
