/T (This quote highlights how policy or regulatory changes that enable advances can create a misleading context for nonprofit organizations, Tribes, and funders. When advances are available, it can appear that cash flow challenges are less significant than they are. However, burdensome and slow processes for cash advances create similar barriers. Moreover, the complexity of managing these cash flow challenges requires nonprofit and Tribal leaders to invest large amounts of time working with their accounting teams to manage liquidity, reducing their ability to focus on other priorities and increasing stress.)
/E (This quote highlights how policy or regulatory changes that enable advances can create a misleading context for nonprofit organizations, Tribes, and funders. When advances are available, it can appear that cash flow challenges are less significant than they are. However, burdensome and slow processes for cash advances create similar barriers. Moreover, the complexity of managing these cash flow challenges requires nonprofit and Tribal leaders to invest large amounts of time working with their accounting teams to manage liquidity, reducing their ability to focus on other priorities and increasing stress.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [5]
>>
