2619 0 obj
<<
/Title (These findings also point to a broader gap in the financial infrastructure that supports government-funded work. While nonprofit organizations and Tribes are expected to implement publicly funded programs, many lack access to the working capital required to manage reimbursement cycles. As a result, organizations must rely on reserves, borrowing, or other stopgap measures to bridge funding gaps.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2587 0 R
/Prev 2601 0 R
/Next 2602 0 R
>>
